WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.729 --> 00:00:02.330
Speaker 1: at this point.

00:00:02.330 --> 00:00:05.980
Fox News is a tool for Russian propaganda.

00:00:05.980 --> 00:00:09.280
Now, I'm not asserting any kind of collusion.

00:00:09.280 --> 00:00:14.619
I'm not saying Russian officials are feeding
talking points to Fox News.

00:00:14.619 --> 00:00:16.279
I'm not saying any of that.

00:00:16.279 --> 00:00:22.660
But what I am saying is Fox News's coverage
of the Russian invasion of Ukraine is really

00:00:22.660 --> 00:00:27.650
useful from the standpoint of propaganda value
to Russian state television.

00:00:27.650 --> 00:00:30.999
I've previously told you about this memo.

00:00:30.999 --> 00:00:33.899
This was about from about a month ago, exactly
a month ago.

00:00:33.899 --> 00:00:42.100
In fact, a Kremlin memo was sent to Russian
media, saying it's essential to feature Tucker

00:00:42.100 --> 00:00:49.300
Carlson's commentaries into in terms of their
coverage of the Russian invasion of Ukraine

00:00:49.300 --> 00:00:52.780
and particularly early on.

00:00:52.780 --> 00:00:58.179
Tucker's coverage was very, very pleasant
for Russian propaganda purposes, so we already

00:00:58.179 --> 00:01:01.899
talked about that previously, that's that
leaked memo.

00:01:01.899 --> 00:01:10.700
We also know that Russian state television
has referred to former Democratic Congresswoman

00:01:10.700 --> 00:01:16.910
Tulsi Gabbard as our friend on the basis of
her interviews with.

00:01:16.910 --> 00:01:17.910
Yes.

00:01:17.910 --> 00:01:20.450
Also with Tucker Carlson.

00:01:20.450 --> 00:01:30.900
And we now also have another example of this
where in Russian media has aired a clip from

00:01:30.900 --> 00:01:39.600
Fox about so-called growing concern over far
left lunacy in schools, which includes trans

00:01:39.600 --> 00:01:40.730
rights.

00:01:40.730 --> 00:01:45.680
Clay Travis was the guest, the right wing
media personality, as he's often referred

00:01:45.680 --> 00:01:48.040
to, and that was also useful.

00:01:48.040 --> 00:01:53.270
Remember that in the midst of the Russian
invasion of Ukraine, Russian state media continues

00:01:53.270 --> 00:02:00.170
to be obsessed with a very similar kind of
anti woke so called and he woke ideology that

00:02:00.170 --> 00:02:06.120
is very much in line with Vladimir Putin's
cultural preferences, cultural positions.

00:02:06.120 --> 00:02:09.819
And there's a lot of great material from Fox
News when it comes to that.

00:02:09.819 --> 00:02:15.159
So it's always really important when we look
at these things to understand that the term

00:02:15.159 --> 00:02:17.540
useful idiot is often really useful.

00:02:17.540 --> 00:02:21.040
And I know it sounds like a pejorative, but
it's a it's a term.

00:02:21.040 --> 00:02:28.609
A useful idiot is someone who is being used
by others for their own gain without even

00:02:28.609 --> 00:02:29.609
realizing it.

00:02:29.609 --> 00:02:34.879
So very often, you know, back in the Trump
Russia investigation days, there were some,

00:02:34.879 --> 00:02:40.209
I guess, who were setting their standard,
as is.

00:02:40.209 --> 00:02:44.720
They're going to be video of Trump colluding
with Vladimir Putin and Putin telling Trump

00:02:44.720 --> 00:02:46.420
what he needs them to do and whatever.

00:02:46.420 --> 00:02:50.489
And as I and many others said, that's never
going to happen.

00:02:50.489 --> 00:02:51.760
That's not how these things work.

00:02:51.760 --> 00:02:53.120
We're not talking about that.

00:02:53.120 --> 00:02:59.480
What we're talking about is more of a useful
idiot relationship where Trump wouldn't even

00:02:59.480 --> 00:03:05.189
realize that he is furthering the goals of
Russia, which is making the U.S. look like

00:03:05.189 --> 00:03:11.090
a joke, which it was when Trump was president,
making our democracy appear unstable by fomenting

00:03:11.090 --> 00:03:15.519
the idea that what we did, did the winner
really win this type of thing?

00:03:15.519 --> 00:03:20.680
And similarly, it's not that Russia's giving
Tucker Carlson talking points.

00:03:20.680 --> 00:03:27.269
It's sort of similar to I hate to say this
because I had friends who worked for our television,

00:03:27.269 --> 00:03:32.750
but a lot of our people used to call when
Archie was still on the air in the U.S., they

00:03:32.750 --> 00:03:33.750
would say.

00:03:33.750 --> 00:03:34.750
They hired me.

00:03:34.750 --> 00:03:36.209
They never told me what I had to say.

00:03:36.209 --> 00:03:37.739
They never edited my scripts.

00:03:37.739 --> 00:03:38.739
They never.

00:03:38.739 --> 00:03:40.620
I do whatever I want here.

00:03:40.620 --> 00:03:46.300
You were hired either because what you are
already planning to say is useful to Russian

00:03:46.300 --> 00:03:52.659
state media or because your presence by virtue
of your identity is useful even if you're

00:03:52.659 --> 00:03:54.599
not toeing the party line.

00:03:54.599 --> 00:03:58.680
It's sort of, like you could say, when Shep
Smith was on Fox News and we would say he's

00:03:58.680 --> 00:04:02.629
his lone voice of reason.

00:04:02.629 --> 00:04:07.739
And it was the the whole point was it allowed
Fox to say, we're fair and balanced.

00:04:07.739 --> 00:04:09.909
We have all sorts of different views here.

00:04:09.909 --> 00:04:14.129
Nobody was telling Shep what to say, but he
was on for one hour and then the rest, and

00:04:14.129 --> 00:04:15.950
then they could say, Well, you know, we're
fair and balanced.

00:04:15.950 --> 00:04:17.140
We we have all sorts of views.

00:04:17.140 --> 00:04:23.760
So understand when we say useful idiot, it's
the term idiot is pejorative, but useful idiot

00:04:23.760 --> 00:04:31.280
in total describes someone who is unknowingly
being used by others to further their agenda.

00:04:31.280 --> 00:04:35.560
And that's exactly what we're seeing on Fox
News next Tuesday.

